# How the harness talks to llmbridge. Sourced by run-on-instance.sh.
#
# The venue dialect is openai, so chat and responses byte-forward to the mock with
# the request line intact. /v1/messages is a different pair: the caller speaks
# Anthropic and the venue speaks OpenAI, and that translator is not built, so the
# gateway refuses it before contacting the upstream. Expect 4 of 6 workloads, and
# report the refusal as a refusal instead of letting it read as a failure.
IMAGE=llmbridge:bench
PORT=8080
MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
HEADERS=()
